      <div class="wrapper-attribution__lesson-grid">
        <article>
          <h5>{t('对模型训练', 'For model training')}</h5>
          <p><strong>{t('格式稳定性和任务能力需要分开测量。', 'Format stability and task capability need separate measurements.')}</strong>{t('这次 BASE 能生成完整的 search[...] / click[...]，只是外层 wrapper 会漂。以后训练应该把任务分数、command 是否合法、wrapper 是否合规分开记录；如果真的要提高格式稳定性，就单独做 format-conformance 数据或训练对照，直接比较训练前后的格式错误频率，而不是从任务分数反推。', 'Here BASE can generate a complete search[...] / click[...] command while the outer wrapper drifts. Future training should track task score, command validity, and wrapper compliance separately. If we want to improve format stability, use dedicated format-conformance data or a controlled training comparison and measure the before/after error rate directly instead of inferring it from task score.')}</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h5>{t('对下一步实验', 'For the next experiment')}</h5>
          <p><strong>{t('正式跑分前，先证明“模型输出 → parser → 环境动作”这条链是通的。', 'Before formal scoring, prove that model output → parser → environment action works end to end.')}</strong>{t('以后正式消耗 held-out 任务之前，要先在非正式 / dev 样本上用真实模型输出做 round-trip preflight：parser 必须能把模型想做的完整 search[...] / click[...] 恢复出来，再送进环境。invalid action 一旦异常升高就应该立刻停，不要等 128 题整轮跑完才发现测量接口坏了。parser 如果改动，要把它当成执行语义变化并重跑相关评测，而不是只“重新算一次分”。', 'Before consuming formal held-out tasks, run a round-trip preflight on non-formal/dev examples using real model outputs: the parser must recover the model’s complete intended search[...] / click[...] command before it reaches the environment. If invalid actions spike, stop immediately rather than discovering a broken measurement interface after all 128 tasks have run. A parser change should be treated as an execution-semantics change that requires the affected evaluation to be rerun, not merely rescored.')}</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="wrapper-attribution__boundary"><strong>{t('证据边界：', 'Evidence boundary: ')}</strong>{t('现有证据能确认三件事：Prompt 没有要求 [action]，推理后端没有改写括号，BASE 在训练前就会出现这种格式漂移。但不能继续定位到 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 的哪一条预训练 / SFT 数据，所以对模型行为的起源归因到这里为止；这里也不声称 SD-LoRA 绝不可能改变 wrapper frequency，只能说这种漂移在训练前已经存在。', 'The current evidence establishes three things: the prompt did not request [action], the inference backend did not rewrite brackets, and BASE already shows this format drift before adapter training. We cannot trace the model behavior further to a specific Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct pretraining/SFT example, so attribution of the model behavior stops there. We also do not claim that SD-LoRA could never change wrapper frequency; only that the drift already exists before adapter training.')}</p>
  </div>
</details>

